# The ACU compose file uses this directory as build context for the .NET
# services. Keep the context limited to projects their Dockerfiles copy.
**
!ApiGateway/
!ApiGateway/**
!BE/
!BE/AcuStorage/
!BE/AcuStorage/**
!BE/MdnsAdvertiser/
!BE/MdnsAdvertiser/**
!_Globals/
!_Globals/PropertySheets/
!_Globals/PropertySheets/**

# Never send local build output even below an included project.
**/[Bb]in/
**/[Oo]bj/
**/[Pp]ublish/
